    "title": "Demolition company selected for former Libbey Glass plant in Shreveport - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aysha Decuir ,\n5 hours ago SHREVEPORT, La. (KSLA) - A company has been picked to handle cleanup and demolition at the old Libbey Glass plant on Jewella Avenue in Shreveport. The North Louisiana Economic Partnership said Lloyd D. Nabors Demolition has been awarded the job. The 54-acre industrial property at 4302 Jewella was bought by... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
